      <activity id="435c0cda-58ff-57ee-83a3-724226cfcb6a" activityNameId="232b41e1-7fdf-53bb-a336-9d9540324287" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium phosphate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium phosphate, at plant
The functional unit represents a 56% solution of sodium phosphate, but all data refer to 100% of the acting substance. The data are based on Landbank report about phosphate in detergents (established for UK conditions);
CAS number: 007601-54-9; 
Formula: Na3O4P; 
UUID: dcb3e582-0c09-3f27-bbd1-a76b2a772c2c
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of sodium phosphate out of phosphoric aicd. Transport and infrastructure have been estimated. No water emissions are accounted for.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average technology for the examined area / time
Time period: date of published literature
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dcb3e582-0c09-3f27-bbd1-a76b2a772c2c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
